	APPLIES_TO_PACKAGE @PACKAGE.core_mapping
	ASSUMES @HYPOTHESIS.TreePlanter3PodUndergroundRocketAnimals2DrawNoPower
	RATIONALE "The eleven-machine limitation is believed to actually cost power in-game, so"
		+ "excluding those machines underestimates consumption; the hypothesis states the opposite"
