DECISION TheSectionValidatorsAreGeneratedAndVersioned
	SPEC "The section validators are Ajv standalone code generated from the JSON Schemas of"
		+ "shared-save-processing into core-mapping and versioned; the CLI and the web UI validate"
		+ "through that module, and no schema is compiled at run time"
